WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.968
In Symfony, PHP and Twig render
catalogs that translators or

2
00:00:04.968 --> 00:00:06.395
a TMS write.

3
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:08.799
Symfony does its part well,

4
00:00:08.799 --> 00:00:11.376
with ICU plurals, fallbacks,

5
00:00:11.376 --> 00:00:12.919
and translation providers.

6
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:17.121
General Translation translates
your catalogs in CI and keeps

7
00:00:17.121 --> 00:00:18.548
them current with your source.

8
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.914
Point the gt config
at your catalogs,

9
00:00:21.914 --> 00:00:23.562
with the locale in the file name.

10
00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:29.166
Run npx gt translate in CI after
translation:extract adds new

11
00:00:29.166 --> 00:00:30.024
English keys.

12
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:32.740
A Glossary keeps terms consistent,

13
00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:35.398
and reviewers edit
translations in the Dashboard.

14
00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:38.599
Your team now ships
French with each release.
